<title>CANADA: St. Laurent Q4 profit turns to loss.</title>
<headline>St. Laurent Q4 profit turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			 1995</p>
<p> Shr  Loss		 C$0.39   Profit	C$0.45</p>
<p> Net  Loss		  5,254   Profit	 8,784</p>
<p> Revs		     125,472		  102,480</p>
<p>	   12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr  Loss		 C$0.57   Profit	C$5.47</p>
<p> Net  Loss		  7,570   Profit	72,319</p>
<p> Revs		     456,994		  469,741</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,311		   13,237</p>
<p>(All data above 0000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>Note: Full company name is St. Laurent Paperboard Inc. Fourth-quarter and year 1995 figures restated. Per share earnings figures are basic. Fully diluted earnings per share were C$0.45 in fourth quarter 1995 and C$3.30 for full year 1995. Fully diluted losses per share for 1996 not available as would be anti-dilutive.</p>
<p>((Reuters Montreal bureau 514-985-2434))</p>
